# Agatha's Soul Cauldron lends Loki Laufeyson's activated abilities (CR 613.1f) to a creature with a +1/+1 counter. Faithless Looting
# discards Loki on turn 3, the Cauldron exiles it and counters Ornithopter, and Ornithopter ({1}, {T}: "When you next cast an instant or
# sorcery spell with mana value less than or equal to Loki's power this turn, copy that spell") sets up Loki's delayed ability, which
# belongs to Loki's card, not to the Ornithopter that has the ability (CR 113.6). Lightning Bolt (mana value 1, Loki's power 2) at Bot2
# is copied, the copy kept on Bot2: Bot2 takes 3 + 3.

